    Foundry Free Font Licence via Fontshare — free for personal and
    commercial use.

  - Geist (`public/Geist-Regular.ttf`) is licensed under the SIL Open Font
    Licence 1.1. Copyright 2024 The Geist Project Authors.
    https://github.com/vercel/geist-font

  - The card art (`public/*.webp`) is generated by `tools/make-cards.mjs` from
    `content/works.js` and carries no third-party material.

  - The upstream project's sample imagery, collected from Behance, is NOT in
